\* The code as it is, when GitHub can leave PRs out of a list page (a GraphQL
\* partial error with null nodes).  Converged must hold: a sweep whose list had
\* gaps keeps the watermark, and a later sweep lists the missing PRs.
\* @...@ values are read from the code by check.sh.
SPECIFICATION Spec
CONSTANTS
    PRs = {1, 2}
    MaxTime = 2
    MaxUpdates = 2
    MaxFails = 1
    MaxHourly = 2
    Workers = 1
    StopInclusive = @StopInclusive@
    AdvanceNeedsAllSaved = @AdvanceNeedsAllSaved@
    AdvanceNeedsFullList = @AdvanceNeedsFullList@
    TargetedNeverAdvances = @TargetedNeverAdvances@
    SaveRule = @SaveRule@
    CapAtListTime = @CapAtListTime@
    ClockAhead = FALSE
    SameSecondUpdates = FALSE
    WithRepoAdd = FALSE
    WithPageRefresh = FALSE
    PartialListing = TRUE
INVARIANTS TypeOK Converged
